No installation greeting

On its first activation the extension showed "… Companion extension
successfully installed." as a notification (upstream already hides it in
Firebase Studio and Cloud Shell). The extension is installed on purpose or
comes preinstalled (MariaDB Cloud Workbench), so it stays quiet everywhere.

